sequenceDiagram
    title UC08 选择并预订一日游或周边游产品——对象级顺序图
    actor U as 用户
    participant Page as AttractionList.vue / MyOrders.vue
    participant Controller as TourProductController
    participant Service as TourProductServiceImpl
    participant Product as TourProductMapper / TourProductStepMapper
    participant Booking as TourScheduleMapper / TourOrderMapper
    U->>Page: 选择产品、班期、人数和联系人
    Page->>Controller: POST /api/tour/orders + Idempotency-Key
    Controller->>Service: createBooking(userId,dto)
    Service->>Booking: selectByIdempotencyKey(userId,key)
    alt 首次有效请求
        Service->>Product: getById(productId)
        Service->>Booking: select schedule；deductStock(scheduleId,count)
        Booking-->>Service: 条件更新行数 1
        Service->>Booking: insert TourOrder
        Booking-->>Service: 返回持久化订单
    else 相同幂等请求
        Booking-->>Service: 返回原订单
    else 输入无效或库存不足
        Service-->>Controller: 抛出业务错误并回滚
    end
    Service-->>Controller: TourOrder
    Controller-->>Page: Result<TourOrder>
    Page->>Controller: GET /api/tour/orders 或 /{orderNo}
    Controller->>Service: listUserOrders/getUserOrder(userId,...)
    Service->>Booking: 按 userId 查询
    Booking-->>Page: 返回本人订单详情
    Note over U,Booking: 金额由服务端按班期单价×人数计算；失败无脏订单、无库存损失
